@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title SD-03 - Accept without double booking
actor "Tutor" as Tutor
boundary ":SessionController" as Controller
control ":SessionService" as Service
participant ":Student\nRepository" as Students
participant ":SessionRequest\nRepository" as Requests
Tutor -> Controller: accept(requestId)
Controller -> Service: accept(currentStudentId, requestId)
Service -> Requests: findSummary(requestId): participant IDs
Service -> Students: lock both student rows in ascending ID order
Service -> Requests: findByIdForUpdate(requestId)
Service -> Service: check tutor, PENDING, and future start
Service -> Requests: existsAcceptedOverlap(both students, start, end)
alt [any check fails or overlap exists]
Service --> Controller: reject; rollback; no change
else [all checks pass; no overlap]
Service -> Requests: request.accept(); save(request)
Service --> Controller: ACCEPTED (after commit)
end
note over Service, Requests
The complete operation runs in one service transaction.
Lookup returns are implicit. A missing request immediately aborts.
The service invokes request.accept() before repository.save(request).
Controller redirects only after commit.
end note
@enduml
